          "note": "Read complete Cattani physical pages 1–2 and individually displayed the matching image. Verified Eduardo Cattani, arXiv 0707.1352v2 dated 19 February 2008, and exact title. Checked the classical/mixed Lefschetz and Hodge–Riemann formulations and degree-dependent polarization signs. The introduction explicitly identifies CKS Lemma 1.16 as the descent input, so reading this whole Cattani paper will not mean that the underlying CKS proof was independently read. All mixed classical statements here require Kähler classes, with boundary descent considered later under its exact hypothesis."
