          "note": "Read complete Cattani physical pages 9–10 and individually displayed the matching image. Page 9 explicitly says the involved proof of Theorem 3.2 is CKS §2 and will not be summarized; read the illustrative T=N_0 special-case proof, including image grading, induced form parity and primitive polarization. Corollary 3.4 iterates descent for interior polarizing operators, with a product-insertion pairing and weight drop m. Lemma 4.1 begins the mixed-kernel filtration argument. No assertion that a boundary product is Lefschetz on the original module is inferred; positivity is on the correctly regraded image/annihilator quotient. CKS remains an unreviewed foundational proof in this checkpoint."
